<p>Guzar gayi fatima jahaa'n se, Yateem hai chote chote bache<br />
Ali hai ghar me bas ab akele, Yateem hai chote chote bache</p>

<p>utha ke ranjo alam sidhaare'n, bala ke seh seh ke gham sidhaare'n<br />
ujad gaya ghar hue ye sadme, Yateem hai chote chote bache</p>

<p>jo chot lagti hai nanhe dil par, to maa ki mayyat ke paas aakar<br />
pukaarte hai lipat lipat kar, Yateem hai chote chote bache</p>

<p>ye roke farma rahe hai hyder, palenge mujhse sagheer kyu'n kar<br />
inhe'n koi kis tarah sambhaale, Yateem hai chote chote bache</p>

<p>ab in ko neend aaye shab ko kyu'n kar, thapak ke jisko sulaae maadar<br />
the maa ke pehlu me sone waale, Yateem hai chote chote bache</p>

<p>ye qoob tha mujhko mout aati, magar na zahra ki jaan jaati<br />
ye laal kyu'n kar palenge mujh se, Yateem hai chote chote bache<br />
